Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:43.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:48.65,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:51.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:55.15,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:02:00.87,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:07.02,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:11.52,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:14.19,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:25.33,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:30.58,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:34.40,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:36.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
